{"seq":2,"slug":"one-on-one","title":"一对一与持续反馈","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/feedback-performance-management/one-on-one","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"one-on-one-structure","title":"一对一会议结构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/feedback-performance-management/one-on-one/one-on-one-structure","wordCount":1799,"readingTime":8},{"seq":2,"slug":"continuous-feedback-culture","title":"持续反馈文化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/feedback-performance-management/one-on-one/continuous-feedback-culture","wordCount":1878,"readingTime":8},{"seq":3,"slug":"difficult-conversations","title":"困难对话处理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/feedback-performance-management/one-on-one/difficult-conversations","wordCount":2086,"readingTime":9}],"introMarkdown":"# 一对一与持续反馈\n\n一对一会议是反馈落地的主要载体，持续反馈文化则是让反馈从\"事件\"变为\"习惯\"的系统设计。本章覆盖三个关键场景：如何设计高效的一对一会议结构、如何在组织中建立持续反馈的节奏与工具支撑、以及如何处理反馈过程中不可避免的困难对话。\n\n本章假设读者已具备第一章的反馈模型知识。学完本章后，你将能够设计并运营一套贯穿日常工作的反馈机制，为绩效周期中的正式评估积累充分的数据与对话基础。\n"}